      "text": "Seen em I have.  Ran like hell, I did.  If yer lookin for 'em, you'll find 'em over there. #【MacRae points over to the east】",
      "source_text": "Seen em I have.  Ran like hell, I did.  If yer lookin for 'em, you'll find 'em over there. \n#【MacRae points over to the east】",
      "source_line_start": 76,
