      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 60,
      "number": 127,
      "number_raw": "127",
      "source_number": "127",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "利刃帮可是一群好人。周旋于那些混蛋管理者和死亡爪之间，对利刃帮来说这并不意味着是他们最好的生活，但是他们还是顽强的生活着。",
      "source_text": "利刃帮可是一群好人。周旋于那些混蛋管理者和死亡爪之间，对利刃帮来说这并不意味着是他们最好的生活，但是他们还是顽强的生活着。",
      "source_line_start": 98,
      "source_line_end": 98,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 61,
      "number": 128,
      "number_raw": "128",
      "source_number": "128",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "【MacRae claps you on the back】 Thanks to you, the Blades are going to live a better life.  So, #what can an old Scotsman do for ya?",
      "source_text": "【MacRae claps you on the back】 Thanks to you, the Blades are going to live a better life.  So, \n#what can an old Scotsman do for ya?",
