      "text": "Well I used to be helpin the Blades out by teachin them a few things about protectin themselves #against the DeathClaws and the Regulators.  Now with you takin care of all that, things have been a wee #bit on the boring side lately.",
      "source_text": "Well I used to be helpin the Blades out by teachin them a few things about protectin themselves \n#against the DeathClaws and the Regulators.  Now with you takin care of all that, things have been a wee \n#bit on the boring side lately.",
      "source_line_start": 139,
